The PointNet ranker in fast/pointnet_models.py adapts the point-cloud encoder of
ASAP's released network (plan_sequence/generator/network/), MIT License.

No dataset, mesh, label, or planner trace is stored in this repository. The
assemblies come from the Fusion 360 Gallery Dataset (Autodesk) as processed by
ASAP and are obtained from the ASAP distribution under their own terms. The
simulation labels are published separately; see README.md.

The pretrained checkpoints are distributed separately as metadata-stripped,
weights-only GitHub Release assets and are not stored in Git history.
